  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Dimetrodon, a non-mammalian synapsid rather than a dinosaur, inspired by the D. milleri museum material. Sail tissue, colour and pose are interpretive; the sail function and species-exact anatomy are not asserted.",
    "zh": "异齿龙是非哺乳类合弓动物而非恐龙，以馆藏 D. milleri 材料为主要启发。帆部软组织、颜色和姿态为推断，不断言帆的功能或物种级精确解剖。"
  },
